== Stations ==
Okami Metro stations are renowned for their integration with the city's environment. Following the 2018 privatization, major hubs like [[Okami Central Station]] and [[Miyoshi-Oike]] were renovated to include massive LED displays and biometric ticketing gates.

Universal accessibility is a standard across all 148 stations. The "One Route" initiative ensures that there is at least one barrier-free path from street level to the platform at every station in the network.

